---
const title = "About";
const description =
  "About The Marginalia, an independent journal by Hemang Jindal exploring philosophy, fiction, ethics, and the questions that stay with us.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title} — The Marginalia</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <header>
        <div class="topline">
          <span>INDEPENDENT JOURNAL</span>
          <span class="topline-center">Essays, fiction &amp; reflections</span>
          <span>EST. 2025</span>
        </div>

        <a class="brand" href="/the-marginalia/">
          The <span>Marginalia</span>
        </a>

        <p class="tagline">Notes on philosophy, life, and the things in between.</p>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/the-marginalia/#writing">Essays</a>
          <a href="/the-marginalia/#fiction">Fiction</a>
          <a href="/the-marginalia/#writing">Archive</a>
          <a class="active" href="/the-marginalia/about/">About</a>
          <span class="nav-note">READ SLOWLY. THINK FREELY.</span>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">A NOTE ON THE JOURNAL</p>
          <h1>A place for the questions that <em>stay with us.</em></h1>
          <p class="lead">
            The Marginalia is an independent journal by Hemang Jindal,
            collecting essays on philosophy, fiction, ethics, and the everyday
            questions that deserve a second look.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 &nbsp; THE JOURNAL</p>
          <h2>Not answers handed down, but thoughts worked through.</h2>
          <p>
            Some questions refuse to remain in the margins. They follow us
            through conversations, books, ordinary decisions, and the quiet
            moments when familiar ideas begin to feel less certain.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Marginalia is a place to stay with those questions a little
            longer. Its essays explore philosophy, morality, consciousness,
            belief, and what it means to live alongside other beings. Its
            fiction takes a different route, using imagined worlds to examine
            the things that arguments alone sometimes cannot reach.
          </p>
          <p>
            The aim is not to manufacture certainty. It is to look more
            carefully, question more honestly, and leave room for an idea to
            become more complicated than it first appeared.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 &nbsp; THE AUTHOR</p>
          <h2>Writing in the company of questions.</h2>
          <p>
            I'm Hemang Jindal. I'm interested in philosophy, literature, and
            the questions that emerge where our ideas meet the world we
            actually inhabit.
          </p>
          <p>
            I write to understand things more clearly, even when understanding
            means discovering that a question is harder than I thought. The
            subjects change, but the impulse remains the same: to examine what
            we believe, why we believe it, and what follows if we take those
            beliefs seriously.
          </p>
          <p>
            This journal is part of that process: a record of ideas explored
            in public, rather than conclusions pretending to have arrived
            fully formed.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 &nbsp; WHAT YOU'LL FIND HERE</p>

          <div class="subject">
            <span class="subject-number">I.</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Philosophy &amp; ethics</h3>
              <p>
                Questions about consciousness, morality, belief, suffering,
                and the assumptions that shape how we live.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="subject">
            <span class="subject-number">II.</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Fiction</h3>
              <p>
                Imagined people and worlds that make familiar questions
                strange again—and sometimes reveal what an argument cannot.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="subject">
            <span class="subject-number">III.</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Reflections</h3>
              <p>
                Notes on books, ordinary experiences, and the small
                observations that sometimes lead to larger questions.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="closing">
          <p class="eyebrow">A FINAL THOUGHT</p>
          <blockquote>
            The point isn't always to find an answer. Sometimes it's to learn
            how to ask a better question.
          </blockquote>
          <a href="/the-marginalia/#writing" class="return-link">
            Explore the writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <a class="footer-brand" href="/the-marginalia/">The <em>Marginalia.</em></a>
        <span>Written slowly, published occasionally.</span>
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Hemang Jindal</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f4ec;
    color: #25231f;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .page {
    width: min(100% - 64px, 1040px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  header {
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .topline {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #c8c0b2;
    color: #80786d;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .topline-center {
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 8vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
  }

  .brand span,
  .footer-brand em {
    color: #a64b35;
  }

  .brand span {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 12px 0 25px;
    color: #69645a;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 27px;
    min-height: 43px;
    border-top: 1px dashed #c8c0b2;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #c8c0b2;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  nav a {
    padding: 13px 0;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  nav a.active {
    color: #a64b35;
  }

  .nav-note {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #80786d;
    font-size: 8px;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 76px 0 95px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #a64b35;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2.3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .intro {
    padding-bottom: 47px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #bfb7a9;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  blockquote {
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(37px, 6vw, 57px);
    line-height: 1.28;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: #a64b35;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #625d54;
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 45px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d0c3;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 23px;
    font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 33px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .content-section > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .subject p {
    color: #48453e;
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 2.1;
  }

  .content-section > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0 0 23px;
  }

  .content-section > p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .subject {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 23px 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed #d0c8ba;
  }

  .subject-number {
    padding-top: 4px;
    color: #a64b35;
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .subject h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 21px;
  }

  .subject p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .closing {
    padding-top: 50px;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    color: #37332c;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .return-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #a64b35;
    color: #a64b35;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    min-height: 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid #bfb7a9;
    color: #80786d;
    font-size: 9px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-family: "Libre Baskerville", serif;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page {
      width: calc(100% - 38px);
    }

    .topline {
      font-size: 7px;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }

    .topline-center {
      font-size: 8px;
    }

    .brand {
      letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    nav {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 5px 0;
      font-size: 8px;
    }

    .nav-note {
      display: none;
    }

    main {
      padding: 52px 0 65px;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .content-section {
      padding: 35px 0;
    }

    .content-section > p:not(.eyebrow),
    .subject p {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 22px 0;
    }
  }
</style>